            "text": "I cannot process a refund for order 1002. This order is **not eligible** for a refund.\n\n**Order Details:**\n- Order ID: 1002\n- Item: Festival ticket\n- Amount: $120.00\n- Purchase date: 2 days ago\n- Status: Delivered\n\n**Reason for Denial:**\nThis item was marked as a **final-sale purchase**. According to our refund policy:\n\n> **\"Final-sale items are not refundable.\"**\n\nEven though the order was purchased recently (only 2 days ago, well within the 30-day window) and has been delivered, the final-sale designation means this purchase cannot be refunded under any circumstances.\n\nFestival tickets are typically sold as final-sale items due to their time-sensitive nature and non-transferable characteristics. I apologize that we cannot accommodate your refund request in this case.",
